Software requirements

Windows 10 or 11 (the autostart feature uses the Windows registry)

Python 3 with tkinter, which is included in the normal python.org installer

Python packages: pyserial and pillow


python -m pip install pyserial pillow pystray psutil


*Before you run it*

Close the official Jungle Leopard software and disable its own startup entry. Only one program can use the screen at a time.

Put the script in a permanent folder (not OneDrive or a temporary location) before enabling “Start with Windows”.

Run it with pythonw hongtai_app.py to avoid a console window. If you start it with python from PowerShell, closing PowerShell closes the app.
